  planner_response {
    thinking: "**Defining the Core Objective**\n\nI\'m now laser-focused on defining the core objective of FrogeClose: to be an outcome-based AI agent. My aim is autonomous month-end/quarter-end financial closure and the production of board-ready packages. We want this to be seamless for mid-sized companies, starting with the close process, and then building out from there.\n\n\n**Assessing Relevant Skills**\n\nI\'ve moved on to a skill assessment phase. I\'m confirming that we have relevant skills in frontend design (building that minimalist UI), Gemini API integration (essential for autonomy), and evaluating the need for Firebase and CloudSQL based on the prototype requirements. This focuses on building the core competencies of the AI agent.\n\n\n"
