  planner_response {
    thinking: "**Constructing Backend Architecture**\n\nI\'m now diving into the backend architecture, focusing on `server.ts` and associated modules. The initial step involves outlining the agent orchestration, specifically a multi-step agentic loop built upon a state machine. I\'m starting with the states: `IDLE`, `PLAN`, and `GATHER`.\n\n\n**Refining Agent Workflow**\n\nI\'ve been refining the agent workflow and tools. I am now focused on a loop of `ANALYZE`, `DRAFT`, `SELF_CRITIQUE`, and either `FINALIZE` or `REQUIRES_HUMAN_EXCEPTION`. I have also detailed some new available tools, including functionalities to query accounting policies and reconcile bank statements. I\'ve also detailed the calculation of ARR waterfall metrics and analysis of budget variance with configurable thresholds. Additionally, I\'ve outlined database tables and row-level security policy simulation.\n\n\n**Integrating Gemini and Modules**\n\nI\'m now integrating the Gemini SDK using `@google/genai` and `gemini-3.8-flash`, reading the API key from environment variables. Server-side, I\'m setting a user agent header. The exciting part is how it will generate a board memo, variance critique, and commentary, based on the live financial data using the Gemini API key! If the key is unavailable, or during offline development, a realistic deterministic financial close package will be provided. I\'m organizing the backend into modular files, including types, agent logic, and a database representation.\n\n\n"
    tool_calls {
      id: "call_323133"
      name: "write_to_file"
      arguments_json: "{\"CodeContent\":\"export type CloseJobStatus = \\n  | \'idle\' \\n  | \'planning\' \\n  | \'gathering\' \\n  | \'reconciling\' \\n  | \'analyzing_variance\' \\n  | \'drafting_package\' \\n  | \'self_critiquing\' \\n  | \'requires_exception_review\'\\n  | \'completed\' \\n  | \'failed\';\\n\\nexport type UserRole = \'controller\' | \'external_auditor\' | \'board_observer\';\\n\\nexport interface Organization {\\n  id: string;\\n  name: string;\\n  domain: string;\\n  arr_usd: number;\\n  currency: string;\\n  fiscal_year_end: string;\\n  accounting_basis: \'GAAP\' | \'IFRS\';\\n  pricing_tier: \'outcome_based\';\\n  outcome_rate_per_close: number;\\n}\\n\\nexport interface JobStep {\\n  id: string;\\n  step_number: number;\\n  name: string;\\n  state: CloseJobStatus;\\n  status: \'pending\' | \'running\' | \'completed\' | \'flagged\';\\n  duration_ms: number;\\n  tool_invocations: Array<{\\n    tool: string;\\n    input: Record<string, any>;\\n    output: Record<string, any>;\\n    status: \'success\' | \'warn\' | \'error\';\\n  }>;\\n  reasoning: string;\\n  confidence_score: number; // 0.0 to 1.0\\n  created_at: string;\\n}\\n\\nexport interface FinancialMetric {\\n  name: string;\\n  current_period: number;\\n  prior_period: number;\\n  budget: number;\\n  variance_pct: number;\\n  variance_usd: number;\\n  status: \'favorable\' | \'unfavorable\' | \'neutral\';\\n  commentary?: string;\\n}\\n\\nexport interface VarianceItem {\\n  id: string;\\n  account_code: string;\\n  account_name: string;\\n  category: \'Revenue\' | \'COGS\' | \'R&D\' | \'S&M\' | \'G&A\';\\n  actual_amount: number;\\n  budget_amount: number;\\n  prior_amount: number;\\n  variance_amount: number;\\n  variance_pct: number;\\n  materiality: \'high\' | \'medium\' | \'low\';\\n  ai_analysis: string;\\n  flagged_for_exception: boolean;\\n}\\n\\nexport interface ExceptionItem {\\n  id: string;\\n  title: string;\\n  source: \'Stripe\' | \'Silicon Valley Bank\' | \'Brex\' | \'NetSuite\' | \'Gusto\';\\n  amount: number;\\n  confidence: number;\\n  detected_anomaly: string;\\n  suggested_action: string;\\n  resolved: boolean;\\n  resolution_note?: string;\\n  resolved_by?: string;\\n}\\n\\nexport interface ASC606Waterfall {\\n  month: string;\\n  beginning_deferred_revenue: number;\\n  new_billings: number;\\n  recognized_revenue: number;\\n  ending_deferred_revenue: number;\\n}\\n\\nexport interface ClosePackage {\\n  period: string; // e.g. \\\"Q3 2026 (July - September)\\\"\\n  company_name: string;\\n  arr: number;\\n  mrr: number;\\n  net_retention_rate: number;\\n  gross_margin_pct: number;\\n  burn_multiple: number;\\n  cash_balance: number;\\n  runway_months: number;\\n  \\n  income_statement: {\\n    revenue: {\\n      subscription: number;\\n      usage_services: number;\\n      total: number;\\n    };\\n    cogs: {\\n      hosting_infrastructure: number;\\n      support_success: number;\\n      payment_fees: number;\\n      total: number;\\n    };\\n    gross_profit: number;\\n    operating_expenses: {\\n      research_and_development: number;\\n      sales_and_marketing: number;\\n      general_and_administrative: number;\\n      total: number;\\n    };\\n    operating_income: number;\\n    ebitda: number;\\n    net_income: number;\\n  };\\n  \\n  reconciliation_summary: {\\n    total_transactions_parsed: number;\\n    automated_matches_count: number;\\n    match_rate_pct: number;\\n    variance_items_flagged: number;\\n    exceptions_cleared: number;\\n    unreconciled_delta_usd: number;\\n    debit_credit_invariant_passed: boolean;\\n  };\\n\\n  as606_waterfall: ASC606Waterfall[];\\n  variances: VarianceItem[];\\n  exceptions: ExceptionItem[];\\n  \\n  executive_board_memo: string;\\n  outcome_score: number; // 0 to 100\\n  screen_time_saved_hours: number;\\n  outcome_based_fee_usd: number;\\n  legacy_manual_cost_usd: number;\\n}\\n\\nexport interface AuditLogEntry {\\n  id: string;\\n  timestamp: string;\\n  actor: \'agent\' | \'user\' | \'system\';\\n  action: string;\\n  details: string;\\n  tool_called?: string;\\n  hash: string; // SHA-256 integrity simulation\\n}\\n\\nexport interface KnowledgeDoc {\\n  id: string;\\n  title: string;\\n  category: \'ASC_606\' | \'CHART_OF_ACCOUNTS\' | \'CAPITALIZATION\' | \'APPROVAL_MATRIX\';\\n  content: string;\\n  relevance_score?: number;\\n}\\n\", \"Description\":\"Create TypeScript types for financial close, agent state machine, and data structures\", \"Overwrite\":true, \"TargetFile\":\"/src/types/finance.ts\", \"toolAction\":\"Writing financial types\", \"toolSummary\":\"Create finance.ts types\"}"
