  planner_response {
    thinking: "**Designing the System Architecture**\n\nI\'m now diving into the system design document, specifically tackling the architecture diagram using Mermaid. Then, I\'ll flesh out a multi-step agent state machine. After that, I will construct a complete Postgres SQL schema with RLS policies and pgvector indexing. Finally, I will finalize the security model.\n\n\n"
    tool_calls {
      id: "call_372653"
      name: "write_to_file"
      arguments_json: "{\"CodeContent\":\"# FrogeClose: System Design & Technical Architecture Document\\n\\n## 1. High-Level Architecture Diagram\\n\\n```mermaid\\ngraph TD\\n    Client[FrogeClose Minimalist Executive UI\\\\nReact 19 + Tailwind v4]\\n    \\n    subgraph Edge & API Gateway\\n        Gateway[Express / Next.js API Routes\\\\nRate Limiting & Tenant JWT Auth]\\n    end\\n    \\n    subgraph Agentic Orchestration Layer\\n        StateMachine[State Machine Engine\\\\nPlan -> Gather -> Reconcile -> Analyze -> Draft -> Self-Critique -> Finalize]\\n        GeminiEngine[Gemini 3.8 Flash / Gemini 4 Argon\\\\nStructured Tool Calling & Reasoning]\\n        CodeSandbox[Deterministic Python/Wasm Sandbox\\\\nMath Invariants & Tie-Out Checks]\\n    end\\n\\n    subgraph Storage & Data Layer\\n        PostgreSQL[(PostgreSQL 16 with RLS\\\\nTenant Isolation)]\\n        PgVector[(pgvector Extension\\\\nASC 606 & Policies)]\\n        EncryptedS3[(Encrypted Object Storage\\\\nS3 / GCS with SSE-KMS)]\\n        ImmutableAudit[(Cryptographic Audit Log\\\\nSHA-256 Chained Hashes)]\\n    end\\n\\n    subgraph Integrations & Ingestion\\n        StripeAPI[Stripe Webhooks & Payouts API]\\n        ERP[NetSuite / QuickBooks Online REST]\\n        BankConnect[Plaid / SVB Direct Statements]\\n        OCR[PDF Table Extractor / Vision Engine]\\n    end\\n\\n    Client -->|HTTPS / SSE Stream| Gateway\\n    Gateway -->|Tenant Context (app.current_org_id)| StateMachine\\n    StateMachine <--> GeminiEngine\\n    StateMachine <--> CodeSandbox\\n    StateMachine -->|Policy Embedding Lookup| PgVector\\n    StateMachine -->|Relational State & Jobs| PostgreSQL\\n    StateMachine -->|Raw Invoices & CSVs| EncryptedS3\\n    StateMachine -->|Append-Only Tool Calls| ImmutableAudit\\n    \\n    IngestEngine[File Ingestion & Parsing] --> EncryptedS3\\n    OCR --> IngestEngine\\n    ERP --> IngestEngine\\n    StripeAPI --> IngestEngine\\n    BankConnect --> IngestEngine\\n```\\n\\n---\\n\\n## 2. Complete PostgreSQL Schema with Row-Level Security (RLS)\\n\\n```sql\\n-- Enable necessary extensions\\nCREATE EXTENSION IF NOT EXISTS \\\"uuid-ossp\\\";\\nCREATE EXTENSION IF NOT EXISTS \\\"pgcrypto\\\";\\nCREATE EXTENSION IF NOT EXISTS \\\"vector\\\";\\n\\n-- 1. Organizations (Tenants)\\nCREATE TABLE organizations (\\n    id UUID PRIMARY KEY DEFAULT gen_random_uuid(),\\n    name VARCHAR(255) NOT NULL,\\n    domain VARCHAR(255) NOT NULL UNIQUE,\\n    arr_usd NUMERIC(15, 2) NOT NULL DEFAULT 0.00,\\n    currency VARCHAR(3) NOT NULL DEFAULT \'USD\',\\n    fiscal_year_end VARCHAR(5) NOT NULL DEFAULT \'12-31\',\\n    accounting_basis VARCHAR(10) NOT NULL DEFAULT \'GAAP\',\\n    pricing_tier VARCHAR(50) NOT NULL DEFAULT \'outcome_based\',\\n    outcome_rate_per_close NUMERIC(10, 2) NOT NULL DEFAULT 1250.00,\\n    created_at TIMESTAMPTZ NOT NULL DEFAULT NOW(),\\n    updated_at TIMESTAMPTZ NOT NULL DEFAULT NOW()\\n);\\n\\n-- 2. Users with Roles\\nCREATE TABLE users (\\n    id UUID PRIMARY KEY DEFAULT gen_random_uuid(),\\n    org_id UUID NOT NULL REFERENCES organizations(id) ON DELETE CASCADE,\\n    email VARCHAR(255) NOT NULL UNIQUE,\\n    role VARCHAR(50) NOT NULL CHECK (role IN (\'controller\', \'external_auditor\', \'board_observer\')),\\n    full_name VARCHAR(255) NOT NULL,\\n    created_at TIMESTAMPTZ NOT NULL DEFAULT NOW()\\n);\\n\\n-- 3. Close Jobs (State Machine Instances)\\nCREATE TABLE jobs (\\n    id UUID PRIMARY KEY DEFAULT gen_random_uuid(),\\n    org_id UUID NOT NULL REFERENCES organizations(id) ON DELETE CASCADE,\\n    period VARCHAR(50) NOT NULL, -- e.g. \'2026-Q3\'\\n    status VARCHAR(50) NOT NULL CHECK (\\n        status IN (\'idle\', \'planning\', \'gathering\', \'reconciling\', \'analyzing_variance\', \'drafting_package\', \'self_critiquing\', \'requires_exception_review\', \'completed\', \'failed\')\\n    ),\\n    outcome_score NUMERIC(5, 2) DEFAULT 0.00, -- 0 to 100\\n    screen_time_saved_hours NUMERIC(6, 2) DEFAULT 0.00,\\n    outcome_fee_usd NUMERIC(10, 2) DEFAULT 0.00,\\n    created_by UUID REFERENCES users(id),\\n    created_at TIMESTAMPTZ NOT NULL DEFAULT NOW(),\\n    completed_at TIMESTAMPTZ\\n);\\n\\n-- 4. Job Steps (Deterministic Agent Steps & Tool Invocations)\\nCREATE TABLE job_steps (\\n    id UUID PRIMARY KEY DEFAULT gen_random_uuid(),\\n    job_id UUID NOT NULL REFERENCES jobs(id) ON DELETE CASCADE,\\n    org_id UUID NOT NULL REFERENCES organizations(id) ON DELETE CASCADE,\\n    step_number INT NOT NULL,\\n    name VARCHAR(255) NOT NULL,\\n    state VARCHAR(50) NOT NULL,\\n    status VARCHAR(50) NOT NULL CHECK (status IN (\'pending\', \'running\', \'completed\', \'flagged\')),\\n    duration_ms INT NOT NULL DEFAULT 0,\\n    tool_invocations JSONB NOT NULL DEFAULT \'[]\'::jsonb,\\n    reasoning TEXT,\\n    confidence_score NUMERIC(4, 3) NOT NULL DEFAULT 1.000,\\n    created_at TIMESTAMPTZ NOT NULL DEFAULT NOW()\\n);\\n\\n-- 5. Files & Uploaded Invoices (Encrypted S3 metadata)\\nCREATE TABLE files (\\n    id UUID PRIMARY KEY DEFAULT gen_random_uuid(),\\n    org_id UUID NOT NULL REFERENCES organizations(id) ON DELETE CASCADE,\\n    job_id UUID REFERENCES jobs(id) ON DELETE SET NULL,\\n    filename VARCHAR(255) NOT NULL,\\n    file_type VARCHAR(50) NOT NULL,\\n    s3_key VARCHAR(512) NOT NULL,\\n    sha256_checksum VARCHAR(64) NOT NULL,\\n    file_size_bytes BIGINT NOT NULL,\\n    pii_redacted BOOLEAN NOT NULL DEFAULT FALSE,\\n    created_at TIMESTAMPTZ NOT NULL DEFAULT NOW()\\n);\\n\\n-- 6. Immutable Audit Logs (Cryptographically Chained)\\nCREATE TABLE audit_logs (\\n    id UUID PRIMARY KEY DEFAULT gen_random_uuid(),\\n    org_id UUID NOT NULL REFERENCES organizations(id) ON DELETE CASCADE,\\n    job_id UUID REFERENCES jobs(id),\\n    actor_type VARCHAR(50) NOT NULL CHECK (actor_type IN (\'agent\', \'user\', \'system\')),\\n    actor_id VARCHAR(255),\\n    action VARCHAR(100) NOT NULL,\\n    tool_called VARCHAR(100),\\n    details JSONB NOT NULL DEFAULT \'{}\'::jsonb,\\n    previous_hash VARCHAR(64),\\n    current_hash VARCHAR(64) NOT NULL,\\n    created_at TIMESTAMPTZ NOT NULL DEFAULT NOW()\\n);\\n\\n-- 7. Outcome Billing Events\\nCREATE TABLE billing_events (\\n    id UUID PRIMARY KEY DEFAULT gen_random_uuid(),\\n    org_id UUID NOT NULL REFERENCES organizations(id) ON DELETE CASCADE,\\n    job_id UUID NOT NULL REFERENCES jobs(id),\\n    amount_usd NUMERIC(10, 2) NOT NULL,\\n    billing_status VARCHAR(50) NOT NULL CHECK (billing_status IN (\'pending\', \'charged\', \'refunded\', \'waived\')),\\n    stripe_charge_id VARCHAR(255),\\n    idempotency_key VARCHAR(255) NOT NULL UNIQUE,\\n    created_at TIMESTAMPTZ NOT NULL DEFAULT NOW()\\n);\\n\\n-- 8. Knowledge Base & Accounting Policies with pgvector\\nCREATE TABLE knowledge_base (\\n    id UUID PRIMARY KEY DEFAULT gen_random_uuid(),\\n    org_id UUID NOT NULL REFERENCES organizations(id) ON DELETE CASCADE,\\n    title VARCHAR(255) NOT NULL,\\n    category VARCHAR(50) NOT NULL,\\n    content TEXT NOT NULL,\\n    embedding vector(1536), -- compatible with text-embedding models\\n    created_at TIMESTAMPTZ NOT NULL DEFAULT NOW(),\\n    updated_at TIMESTAMPTZ NOT NULL DEFAULT NOW()\\n);\\n\\n-- Vector Cosine Indexing\\nCREATE INDEX IF NOT EXISTS knowledge_base_embedding_idx \\nON knowledge_base \\nUSING ivfflat (embedding vector_cosine_ops) \\nWITH (lists = 100);\\n\\n-- Enable Row-Level Security (RLS) on all multi-tenant tables\\nALTER TABLE organizations ENABLE ROW LEVEL SECURITY;\\nALTER TABLE users ENABLE ROW LEVEL SECURITY;\\nALTER TABLE jobs ENABLE ROW LEVEL SECURITY;\\nALTER TABLE job_steps ENABLE ROW LEVEL SECURITY;\\nALTER TABLE files ENABLE ROW LEVEL SECURITY;\\nALTER TABLE audit_logs ENABLE ROW LEVEL SECURITY;\\nALTER TABLE billing_events ENABLE ROW LEVEL SECURITY;\\nALTER TABLE knowledge_base ENABLE ROW LEVEL SECURITY;\\n\\n-- Example RLS Policy enforcing tenant isolation via session setting\\nCREATE POLICY tenant_isolation_policy_jobs ON jobs\\n    USING (org_id = current_setting(\'app.current_org_id\')::uuid);\\n\\nCREATE POLICY tenant_isolation_policy_files ON files\\n    USING (org_id = current_setting(\'app.current_org_id\')::uuid);\\n\\nCREATE POLICY tenant_isolation_policy_audit ON audit_logs\\n    USING (org_id = current_setting(\'app.current_org_id\')::uuid);\\n\\nCREATE POLICY tenant_isolation_policy_kb ON knowledge_base\\n    USING (org_id = current_setting(\'app.current_org_id\')::uuid);\\n```\\n\\n---\\n\\n## 3. Security & Compliance Architecture\\n\\n### Tenant Isolation\\n- **Row-Level Security (RLS):** Every database connection executes inside a transaction setting `SET LOCAL app.current_org_id = \'<authenticated_org_id>\'`. Queries can never leak data cross-tenant at the SQL level.\\n- **Tenant-Scoped Object Storage:** Files are stored under `s3://frogeclose-vault/${org_id}/${job_id}/${file_id}` encrypted with customer-managed or envelope KMS keys.\\n\\n### Mathematical Invariant Code Sandbox\\n- Large language models are probabilistic, but double-entry accounting is non-negotiably deterministic.\\n- Financial computations (summing debits/credits, ASC 606 ratable amortization schedules, variance percentage formulas) are computed in an isolated execution sandbox.\\n- **The Golden Invariants:**\\n  1. $\\\\sum \\\\text{Debits} \\\\equiv \\\\sum \\\\text{Credits}$ across all journal entries.\\n  2. $\\\\text{Suspense Account Ending Balance} = \\\\$0.00$.\\n  3. $\\\\text{Ending Retained Earnings} = \\\\text{Beginning Retained Earnings} + \\\\text{GAAP Net Income} - \\\\text{Dividends}$.\\n  4. $\\\\text{Ending Operating Cash} = \\\\text{Bank Verified Depository Balance}$.\\n\\n### Automated PII Redaction\\n- Invoices and employee expense receipts pass through a streaming redaction filter before vectorization or LLM prompt construction. Personal addresses, SSNs/tax IDs, and personal credit card numbers are replaced with deterministic surrogate tokens (`[REDACTED_TIN_01]`).\\n\\n---\\n\\n## 4. Multi-Role Collaboration Model\\n- **Controller / Finance VP:** Full admin permissions. Triggers close jobs, modifies journal thresholds, resolves exceptions, and approves the final ledger lock.\\n- **External Auditor (PwC, EY, BDO):** Read-only immutable access. Can inspect every tool invocation, source document link, and cryptographic SHA-256 hash verifying the tie-out.\\n- **Board Observer / CEO:** Clean 1-page executive dashboard with key SaaS indicators (ARR, NDR, Net Burn, Runway, Rule of 40) and downloadable PDF memos.\\n\", \"Description\":\"Create comprehensive SYSTEM_DESIGN.md technical document\", \"Overwrite\":true, \"TargetFile\":\"/SYSTEM_DESIGN.md\", \"toolAction\":\"Writing system design document\", \"toolSummary\":\"Create SYSTEM_DESIGN.md\"}"
