  planner_response {
    thinking: "**Building the Frontend**\n\nI\'m now focusing on constructing the frontend application, meticulously reviewing the UI/UX requirements stemming from the prompt. I\'m prioritizing the frontend architecture and aiming for minimal dark-mode aesthetics.\n\n\n**Refining the UI**\n\nI\'m currently engaged in refining the user interface, emphasizing a minimalist dark-mode style, which means avoiding any cheesy gradients in the design. I\'m focusing on neutral colors and hairline borders. I\'m prioritizing clean typography and tabular numerals and enforcing a top bar contract with specific zones for the brand, navigation, and primary action. I also am working on making an executive view as the main close console.\n\n\n**Designing the User Interface**\n\nI\'m now integrating crucial features into the user interface. I\'ve added a \"Run Close\" action button for the autonomous agent loop, along with a real-time progress tracker displaying agent states and metrics. I\'m also building an outcome and value header bar, including an outcome score, estimated time saved, and mock outcome-based pricing. Lastly, I\'m developing tabs for the close package, including a Board Deck and Executive Memo view, and a GAAP Reconciled P&L view.\n\n\n**Analyzing Financial Data**\n\nI\'m now diving into detailed financial data visualization. I\'m focusing on subscription revenue, usage, COGS, and other key metrics. I\'m building interactive tables to show budget variances and attribute root causes. I\'m also planning an ASC 606 revenue waterfall visualization for deferred revenue.\n\n\n**Developing Key Components**\n\nI\'m now focusing on several essential components. Specifically, I\'m working on an audit trail viewer that features a cryptographic SHA-256 log stream to track every tool call, invariant check, and timestamp. I\'m also planning in-app viewers for critical documents, including the YC/a16z Pitch Memo, Business Model, and Evaluation Harness. I\'m prioritizing building the following components: `TopNav.tsx`, `CloseGoalInput.tsx`, `AgentProgressStepper.tsx`, `OutcomeKpiStrip.tsx`, `BoardMemoView.tsx`, `FinancialStatementsView.tsx`, `VarianceTableView.tsx`, `ExceptionInbox.tsx`, `AuditTrailView.tsx`, `SchemaArchitectureModal.tsx`, `PitchMemoModal.tsx`, `ExportModal.tsx`, and `App.tsx`.\n\n\n"
    tool_calls {
      id: "call_391628"
      name: "write_to_file"
      arguments_json: "{\"CodeContent\":\"import React from \'react\';\\nimport { UserRole } from \'../types/finance.ts\';\\nimport { ShieldCheck, Database, FileText, Cpu, CheckCircle } from \'lucide-react\';\\n\\ninterface TopNavProps {\\n  currentRole: UserRole;\\n  onRoleChange: (role: UserRole) => void;\\n  onOpenArchitecture: () => void;\\n  onOpenPitch: () => void;\\n  activeView: \'close\' | \'audit\' | \'knowledge\';\\n  onViewChange: (view: \'close\' | \'audit\' | \'knowledge\') => void;\\n}\\n\\nexport const TopNav: React.FC<TopNavProps> = ({\\n  currentRole,\\n  onRoleChange,\\n  onOpenArchitecture,\\n  onOpenPitch,\\n  activeView,\\n  onViewChange,\\n}) => {\\n  return (\\n    <header className=\\\"border-b border-neutral-800 bg-[#0c0f16] px-6 py-3.5 sticky top-0 z-40\\\">\\n      <div className=\\\"max-w-7xl mx-auto flex items-center justify-between gap-8\\\">\\n        {/* Zone 1: Brand Wordmark */}\\n        <div className=\\\"flex items-center gap-3 shrink-0\\\">\\n          <a href=\\\"/\\\" className=\\\"flex items-center gap-2.5 text-slate-100 group\\\">\\n            <div className=\\\"w-8 h-8 rounded-lg bg-emerald-500/10 border border-emerald-500/30 flex items-center justify-center text-emerald-400 group-hover:border-emerald-500/50 transition-colors\\\">\\n              <Cpu className=\\\"w-4 h-4 text-emerald-400\\\" />\\n            </div>\\n            <div>\\n              <div className=\\\"text-base font-bold tracking-tight text-white flex items-center gap-1.5\\\">\\n                FrogeClose\\n                <span className=\\\"text-[10px] uppercase font-mono tracking-wider text-emerald-400 bg-emerald-950/60 border border-emerald-800/40 px-1.5 py-0.5 rounded\\\">Outcome Engine</span>\\n              </div>\\n              <div className=\\\"text-[11px] text-slate-400 font-mono\\\">FrogeClose.com \302\267 Autonomous SaaS Close</div>\\n            </div>\\n          </a>\\n        </div>\\n\\n        {/* Zone 2: Navigation Links / Views */}\\n        <nav className=\\\"hidden md:flex items-center gap-6 text-xs font-medium text-slate-300\\\">\\n          <button\\n            onClick={() => onViewChange(\'close\')}\\n            className={`transition-colors whitespace-nowrap pb-0.5 ${\\n              activeView === \'close\'\\n                ? \'text-emerald-400 border-b-2 border-emerald-400 font-semibold\'\\n                : \'text-slate-400 hover:text-slate-200\'\\n            }`}\\n          >\\n            Autonomous Close\\n          </button>\\n          \\n          <button\\n            onClick={() => onViewChange(\'audit\')}\\n            className={`transition-colors whitespace-nowrap pb-0.5 ${\\n              activeView === \'audit\'\\n                ? \'text-emerald-400 border-b-2 border-emerald-400 font-semibold\'\\n                : \'text-slate-400 hover:text-slate-200\'\\n            }`}\\n          >\\n            Audit & Invariants\\n          </button>\\n\\n          <button\\n            onClick={() => onViewChange(\'knowledge\')}\\n            className={`transition-colors whitespace-nowrap pb-0.5 ${\\n              activeView === \'knowledge\'\\n                ? \'text-emerald-400 border-b-2 border-emerald-400 font-semibold\'\\n                : \'text-slate-400 hover:text-slate-200\'\\n            }`}\\n          >\\n            Knowledge & ASC 606\\n          </button>\\n\\n          <button\\n            onClick={onOpenArchitecture}\\n            className=\\\"text-slate-400 hover:text-slate-200 transition-colors whitespace-nowrap flex items-center gap-1\\\"\\n          >\\n            <Database className=\\\"w-3.5 h-3.5 text-slate-400\\\" />\\n            System Architecture\\n          </button>\\n\\n          <button\\n            onClick={onOpenPitch}\\n            className=\\\"text-slate-400 hover:text-slate-200 transition-colors whitespace-nowrap flex items-center gap-1\\\"\\n          >\\n            <FileText className=\\\"w-3.5 h-3.5 text-slate-400\\\" />\\n            YC / a16z Memo\\n          </button>\\n        </nav>\\n\\n        {/* Zone 3: Multi-Role Switcher & Primary Action */}\\n        <div className=\\\"flex items-center gap-3 shrink-0\\\">\\n          {/* Role selector for multiplayer review */}\\n          <div className=\\\"flex items-center gap-1.5 bg-[#141923] border border-neutral-800 rounded-md p-1 text-xs\\\">\\n            <span className=\\\"text-[11px] text-slate-400 pl-1.5 hidden sm:inline\\\">Role:</span>\\n            <select\\n              value={currentRole}\\n              onChange={(e) => onRoleChange(e.target.value as UserRole)}\\n              className=\\\"bg-transparent text-slate-200 text-xs font-medium focus:outline-none cursor-pointer pr-1\\\"\\n            >\\n              <option value=\\\"controller\\\" className=\\\"bg-[#141923] text-slate-200\\\">\\n                Controller (Admin)\\n              </option>\\n              <option value=\\\"external_auditor\\\" className=\\\"bg-[#141923] text-slate-200\\\">\\n                External Auditor (PwC)\\n              </option>\\n              <option value=\\\"board_observer\\\" className=\\\"bg-[#141923] text-slate-200\\\">\\n                Board Observer (VC)\\n              </option>\\n            </select>\\n          </div>\\n\\n          <div className=\\\"hidden lg:flex items-center gap-1.5 text-emerald-400 text-[11px] font-mono bg-emerald-950/40 border border-emerald-900/40 px-2.5 py-1.5 rounded-md\\\">\\n            <ShieldCheck className=\\\"w-3.5 h-3.5\\\" />\\n            <span>RLS Protected</span>\\n          </div>\\n        </div>\\n      </div>\\n    </header>\\n  );\\n};\\n\", \"Description\":\"Create TopNav component with brand, navigation, and role switcher\", \"Overwrite\":true, \"TargetFile\":\"/src/components/TopNav.tsx\", \"toolAction\":\"Writing TopNav component\", \"toolSummary\":\"Create TopNav.tsx\"}"
