    thinking: "**Analyzing Missing Files**\n\nI\'m currently investigating why `src/types/finance.ts` wasn\'t created. The system had a reset or encountered an error during its anticipated creation. The root directory now contains updated files: `index.html`, `metadata.json`, and `src/index.css`, but not the necessary finance type file. I\'m focusing on the error logs to trace the point of failure.\n\n\n**Constructing FrogeClose**\n\nI\'ve decided to build \"FrogeClose\" directly within `src/App.tsx`, avoiding potential import issues. This will be a self-contained, production-grade application. The plan is to include an autonomous close console with goal input, presets, and connected sources for full interactivity. A multi-step state machine will simulate the closing process, including interactive tool inspections and a top metrics strip.\n\n\n**Defining Deliverables Clearly**\n\nNow, I\'m delineating the key deliverables. They will include an Executive Board Memo, a GAAP Income Statement, an ASC 606 Revenue Waterfall, and a Budget-to-Actuals Variance Table. Also included: a Human-in-the-Loop Exception Inbox for anomaly resolution, an Immutable Audit Trail, a System Architecture & Postgres Schema Inspector, a YC / a16z Pitch Memo, and Evaluation Harness & Quality Benchmarks. I\'m focusing on ensuring each is well-defined and useful.\n\n\n"
    tool_calls {
