            lines {
              text: "## 3. Security & Compliance Architecture"
              type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_DELETE
            }
            lines {
              type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_DELETE
            }
            lines {
              text: "### Tenant Isolation"
              type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_DELETE
            }
            lines {
              text: "- **Row-Level Security (RLS):** Every database connection executes inside a transaction setting `SET LOCAL app.current_org_id = \'<authenticated_org_id>\'`. Queries can never leak data cross-tenant at the SQL level."
              type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_DELETE
            }
            lines {
              text: "- **Tenant-Scoped Object Storage:** Files are stored under `s3://frogeclose-vault/${org_id}/${job_id}/${file_id}` encrypted with customer-managed or envelope KMS keys."
              type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_DELETE
            }
            lines {
              type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_DELETE
            }
            lines {
              text: "### Mathematical Invariant Code Sandbox"
              type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_DELETE
            }
            lines {
              text: "- Large language models are probabilistic, but double-entry accounting is non-negotiably deterministic."
              type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_DELETE
            }
            lines {
              text: "- Financial computations (summing debits/credits, ASC 606 ratable amortization schedules, variance percentage formulas) are computed in an isolated execution sandbox."
              type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_DELETE
            }
            lines {
              text: "- **The Golden Invariants:**"
              type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_DELETE
            }
            lines {
              text: "CREATE POLICY tenant_isolation_jobs ON jobs"
              type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
            }
            lines {
              text: "    USING (org_id = current_setting(\'app.current_org_id\')::uuid);"
              type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
            }
            lines {
              text: "```"
              type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
            }
            lines {
              type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
            }
            lines {
              text: "---"
              type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
            }
            lines {
              type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
            }
            lines {
              text: "## 3. Mathematical Invariant Verification Sandbox"
              type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
            }
            lines {
              text: "- LLMs are probabilistic, but double-entry accounting is non-negotiably deterministic."
              type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
            }
            lines {
              text: "- Mathematical computations execute inside a deterministic sandbox:"
              type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
            }
            lines {
              text: "  1. $\\sum \\text{Debits} \\equiv \\sum \\text{Credits}$ across all journal entries."
              type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_UNCHANGED
            }
            lines {
              text: "  2. $\\text{Suspense Account Ending Balance} = \\$0.00$."
              type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_UNCHANGED
            }
            lines {
              text: "  3. $\\text{Ending Retained Earnings} = \\text{Beginning Retained Earnings} + \\text{GAAP Net Income} - \\text{Dividends}$."
              type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_UNCHANGED
            }
            lines {
              text: "  4. $\\text{Ending Operating Cash} = \\text{Bank Verified Depository Balance}$."
              type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_UNCHANGED
            }
            lines {
              type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_DELETE
            }
            lines {
              text: "### Automated PII Redaction"
              type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_DELETE
            }
            lines {
              text: "- Invoices and employee expense receipts pass through a streaming redaction filter before vectorization or LLM prompt construction. Personal addresses, SSNs/tax IDs, and personal credit card numbers are replaced with deterministic surrogate tokens (`[REDACTED_TIN_01]`)."
              type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_DELETE
            }
            lines {
              type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_DELETE
            }
            lines {
              text: "---"
              type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_DELETE
            }
            lines {
              type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_DELETE
            }
            lines {
              text: "## 4. Multi-Role Collaboration Model"
              type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_DELETE
            }
            lines {
              text: "- **Controller / Finance VP:** Full admin permissions. Triggers close jobs, modifies journal thresholds, resolves exceptions, and approves the final ledger lock."
              type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_DELETE
            }
            lines {
              text: "- **External Auditor (PwC, EY, BDO):** Read-only immutable access. Can inspect every tool invocation, source document link, and cryptographic SHA-256 hash verifying the tie-out."
              type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_DELETE
            }
            lines {
