  planner_response {
    thinking: "**Integrating Recharts**\n\nI\'ve successfully installed `recharts`! My focus now shifts to integrating a bar chart specifically within the Variance Attribution tab of `src/App.tsx`. I\'m starting to identify the necessary components from `recharts` for this bar chart; currently, I\'m thinking of using `BarChart`, `Bar`, `XAxis`, `YAxis`, and `CartesianGrid`.\n\n\n**Enhancing Chart Functionality**\n\nI\'m now incorporating `Tooltip`, `Legend`, and `ResponsiveContainer` into the `recharts` integration. I\'m focusing on the visual comparison of actual versus budget expenditures, considering various categories like Cloud Hosting, SaaS Subscription Revenue, Sales Commissions, and Legal & Compliance. I\'m exploring different grouping options, such as categorizing by expense type or providing a toggle to compare OPEX/COGS versus Revenue. Moreover, I plan to create a visually appealing, high-contrast dark-mode bar chart with specific color schemes for Actual and Budget data.\n\n\n"
