  planner_response {
    thinking: "**Exploring Recharts Components**\n\nI\'m currently investigating the specific Recharts components available for import. My focus is on rendering a clean bar chart using `BarChart`, `Bar`, `XAxis`, `YAxis`, `CartesianGrid`, `Tooltip`, `Legend`, and `ResponsiveContainer`. I\'m aiming for clarity in implementation.\n\n\n**Defining Chart Data**\n\nI\'m now focusing on how to structure the data for the bar chart within the Variance Attribution tab. I\'m exploring two main options: comparing individual line items, like \"Hosting & GPU\", or aggregating by full departmental expenditures, such as \"Cost of Revenue (COGS)\". I\'m leaning toward presenting both, to allow users to grasp the data at different granularities.\n\n\n"
