is`, `YAxis`), and data keys. I\'m seeing customization for ticks, intervals, angles, text anchors, and stroke colors.\n\n\n**Scrutinizing Tooltip Content**\n\nI\'m now examining the Recharts tooltip. I\'m noting the custom `Tooltip` component\'s structure: conditional rendering based on `active` and `payload`, and the detailed information display for each data point. It includes department name, formatted values, and difference calculations. I\'m paying close attention to the formatting and styling of the tooltip content using tailwind classes.\n\n\n**Observing Key Values**\n\nI\'m now zeroing in on the display of actual versus budget values. I\'m noting the use of inline block spans with specific colors and rounded corners. I am noting the use of `tabular-nums` for numeric formatting. I\'m also seeing how the budget value is grayed out compared to the actual value. I am noting how the data is being formatted to the nearest thousands as well.\n\n\n**Evaluating Value Formatting**\n\nI\'m now focused on how the \'Net Variance\' values are being rendered. I\'m noting the conditional text colors based on whether the variance is positive or negative. I\'m paying attention to the `tabular-nums` class for consistent formatting, the use of `toFixed(1)` for precision, and the formatting of the result as a percentage. I am also seeing the `Legend` code.\n\n\n"
