    thinking: "**Adding Batch Exception Approval**\n\nI\'m currently integrating a new function, `handleApproveAllExceptions`, designed to batch-approve all pending exceptions. It will be placed directly after the existing `handleResolveException` function. The initial implementation includes a check to ensure there are actually pending exceptions before proceeding.\n\n\n"
    tool_calls {
      id: "call_320242"
      name: "replace_file_content"
