            }
            lines {
              text: "### 3. Business Model: Outcome-Based Billing"
              type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_DELETE
            }
            lines {
              text: "We do not sell per-seat subscriptions. Per-seat pricing incentivizes bloated software and slow processes."
              type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_DELETE
            }
            lines {
              text: "- We charge **$1,250 per successful monthly close** and **$2,500 per quarter-end close + board package**."
              type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_DELETE
            }
            lines {
              text: "- If our agent fails to balance the books (Debits $\\neq$ Credits), **the customer pays zero**."
              type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_DELETE
            }
            lines {
              text: "- **Unit Economics:** Compute + LLM inference cost is ~$2.50 per close. That represents a **99.8% gross margin** on outcome delivery."
