              type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_DELETE
            }
            lines {
              text: "### 4. Why We Win (The Moat)"
              type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_DELETE
            }
            lines {
              text: "1. **Deterministic Guardrails vs. Stochastic LLMs:** General-purpose AI chatbots cannot do accounting because accounting requires exact decimal balance. FrogeClose combines Gemini 3.8 Flash\342\200\231s deep reasoning with an isolated mathematical sandbox enforcing GAAP invariants."
              type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_DELETE
