            lines {
              text: "2. **Proprietary Institutional Knowledge (`pgvector`):** The hardest part of accounting is context: *\342\200\234How does this company treat multi-year enterprise contracts under ASC 606?\342\200\235* FrogeClose remembers every past close, contract nuance, and policy approval in an RLS-isolated vector vault."
              type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_DELETE
            }
            lines {
              text: "3. **Multiplayer System of Record:** Once we generate the board package, the CEO, External Auditor (PwC/EY), and Board of Directors collaborate directly within FrogeClose, locking in massive switching costs."
              type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_DELETE
            }
            lines {
              type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_DELETE
