              type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_DELETE
            }
            lines {
              type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_DELETE
            }
            lines {
              text: "### 5. Why Back a Solo Technical Founder Now?"
              type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_DELETE
            }
            lines {
              text: "With modern AI coding workflows and autonomous agent architectures, a single technical founder can build and scale what previously required a 40-person engineering team. We are shipping fast, keeping burn near zero, and building directly for paying finance leaders."
