            }
            lines {
              text: "                  FloQast and BlackLine are checklist and workflow management tools that still require humans to perform every reconciliation in Excel. Rillet is an ERP replacement that incurs massive migration friction. FrogeClose sits on top of existing stacks (NetSuite, QBO, Stripe) and does the work autonomously."
