  planner_response {
    response: "### Instant CSV Preview Added to the Reconciliation Tab\n\nThe **Reconciliation** tab has been updated to immediately parse and preview the first 5 rows of uploaded **Bank Transactions** and **General Ledger** CSV files, giving controllers instantaneous feedback on file schemas, delimiter parsing, and column mappings before triggering reconciliation.\n\n---\n\n### What Was Built:\n\n1. **Instant 5-Row Data Structure Preview**:\n   - As soon as a user selects or drops a Bank or GL CSV, the client-side `FileReader` and parsing engine extract headers, row counts, and the **first 5 records**.\n   - Displays a live preview card for **Bank Statements** (`sample_bank_svb.csv`) and **General Ledger Journals** (`sample_netsuite_gl.csv`).\n   - Shows detected column data types under each header (`Numeric (USD)`, `ISO Date`, `UUID / Ref`, `Decimal (USD)`, `Chart of Accounts`, `Text`).\n\n2. **Smart Accounting Formatting & Highlighting**:\n   - **Bank CSV Preview**: Highlights `Credit` (cash inflows in emerald green) and `Debit` (disbursements in amber/slate) with tabular monospaced numbers.\n   - **General Ledger Preview**: Distinguishes debit and credit balances with visual color-coding and account code badges (`1010`, `5030`, `2100`, etc.).\n   - Row counter `#` badges (1\342\200\2235) and total parsed record counts (`Showing 5 of N parsed records`).\n\n3. **Flexible Layout Controls**:\n   - **Side-by-Side (Both)** view: Compares Bank Feed and GL columns simultaneously.\n   - **Bank CSV Only** / **GL CSV Only** tabs: For detailed inspection on smaller viewports.\n   - **Reset Samples**: One-click button to reload default synthetic files at any time."
