      text: "Add a React Context provider for user authentication and authorization that gates the \'Controller\' functionality, ensuring \'Reviewer\' and \'Read-only\' roles cannot trigger approvals. Create an overlay that acts as an interactive onboarding tour using a state machine to highlight the key components of the dashboard for new users."
    }
