  planner_response {
    thinking: "**Defining User Role Access**\n\nI\'m now zeroing in on defining the precise user access requirements. The React Context provider is critical for handling user authentication and authorization. It will act as a gatekeeper for the \'Controller\' functionality. It\'s crucial to block \'Reviewer\' and \'Read-only\' roles from actions like approvals and rollbacks. Both individual and batch actions must be restricted.\n\n\n**Refining Authentication Details**\n\nI\'m currently focused on the details for user sign-offs. This will incorporate a comprehensive user context, encompassing user information, authentication status, and permission-checking helpers. The goal is a centralized provider for managing and exposing authorization state, with easy-to-use hooks and guards. This includes a clear denial message when unauthorized actions are attempted. The `AuthProvider`, `useAuth`, and a `<Gate>` are also under consideration.\n\n\n**Visualizing Guided Workflow Implementation**\n\nI\'m now deep-diving into the visual design for the guided workflow. I envision a step indicator and a progress bar to keep users informed. I\'m also planning skip, back, and next/finish buttons. A pulsing highlight with backdrop dimming sounds good for added focus, and I\'ll include keyboard shortcuts. I\'m considering a `useTourStateMachine` for state management, as well as roles. I want to build a clear, interactive visual that enhances the user experience.\n\n\n**Defining Access Gates**\n\nI\'m now integrating permission checks directly into components, using boolean flags like `canRollback` and `canRunClose`. A key piece is the `ControllerGate` component, which will manage access to crucial functionality based on user roles and permissions. I am aiming to ensure that the user experience is secure, and actions such as comments are gated properly, and that unauthorized actions display the `authDeniedModal`. I have defined a finite state machine for the onboarding tour.\n\n\n"
    tool_calls {
      id: "call_454754"
      name: "write_to_file"
      arguments_json: "{\"CodeContent\":\"import React, { createContext, useContext, useState, useMemo, ReactNode } from \'react\';\\nimport { ShieldAlert, Lock, UserCheck, Eye, FileText, CheckCircle2 } from \'lucide-react\';\\n\\nexport type UserRole = \'controller\' | \'reviewer\' | \'read_only\';\\n\\nexport interface AuthUser {\\n  id: string;\\n  name: string;\\n  email: string;\\n  title: string;\\n  role: UserRole;\\n  avatarInitials: string;\\n  department: string;\\n  certifications?: string[];\\n}\\n\\nexport interface AuthContextType {\\n  user: AuthUser;\\n  role: UserRole;\\n  setRole: (role: UserRole) => void;\\n  canApprove: boolean;\\n  canRollback: boolean;\\n  canRunClose: boolean;\\n  canComment: boolean;\\n  isReadOnly: boolean;\\n  requireController: (actionName: string, onSuccess: () => void) => boolean;\\n  deniedNotice: { action: string; reason: string } | null;\\n  clearDeniedNotice: () => void;\\n  usersByRole: Record<UserRole, AuthUser>;\\n}\\n\\nconst PRESET_USERS: Record<UserRole, AuthUser> = {\\n  controller: {\\n    id: \'usr_controller_01\',\\n    name: \'Elena Rostova, CPA\',\\n    email: \'elena.rostova@acme-saas.com\',\\n    title: \'VP of Finance & Corporate Controller\',\\n    role: \'controller\',\\n    avatarInitials: \'ER\',\\n    department: \'Corporate Accounting\',\\n    certifications: [\'CPA (Active)\', \'ASC 606 Certified\', \'SEC Reporting Fellow\'],\\n  },\\n  reviewer: {\\n    id: \'usr_reviewer_02\',\\n    name: \'Marcus Vance\',\\n    email: \'marcus.vance@acme-saas.com\',\\n    title: \'Senior Financial Analyst & Accountant\',\\n    role: \'reviewer\',\\n    avatarInitials: \'MV\',\\n    department: \'FP&A & Revenue Operations\',\\n    certifications: [\'CMA Candidate\'],\\n  },\\n  read_only: {\\n    id: \'usr_readonly_03\',\\n    name: \'Sarah Sterling\',\\n    email: \'s.sterling@altitude-ventures.com\',\\n    title: \'Board Audit Committee Chair & Investor\',\\n    role: \'read_only\',\\n    avatarInitials: \'SS\',\\n    department: \'Board of Directors / Audit Committee\',\\n    certifications: [\'Audit Committee Chair\'],\\n  },\\n};\\n\\nconst AuthContext = createContext<AuthContextType | undefined>(undefined);\\n\\nexport function AuthProvider({ children }: { children: ReactNode }) {\\n  const [role, setRoleState] = useState<UserRole>(\'controller\');\\n  const [deniedNotice, setDeniedNotice] = useState<{ action: string; reason: string } | null>(null);\\n\\n  const user = PRESET_USERS[role];\\n\\n  const permissions = useMemo(() => {\\n    const isCtrl = role === \'controller\';\\n    const isRev = role === \'reviewer\';\\n    const isRO = role === \'read_only\';\\n\\n    return {\\n      canApprove: isCtrl,\\n      canRollback: isCtrl,\\n      canRunClose: isCtrl || isRev,\\n      canComment: isCtrl || isRev,\\n      isReadOnly: isRO,\\n    };\\n  }, [role]);\\n\\n  const setRole = (newRole: UserRole) => {\\n    setRoleState(newRole);\\n    setDeniedNotice(null);\\n  };\\n\\n  const clearDeniedNotice = () => {\\n    setDeniedNotice(null);\\n  };\\n\\n  /**\\n   * Enforces controller authorization gate.\\n   * If user has controller permissions, executes onSuccess() and returns true.\\n   * If user lacks controller permission, triggers authorization denied modal and returns false.\\n   */\\n  const requireController = (actionName: string, onSuccess: () => void): boolean => {\\n    if (permissions.canApprove) {\\n      onSuccess();\\n      return true;\\n    }\\n\\n    const reason =\\n      role === \'read_only\'\\n        ? \'Read-only observers (Board Members & External Auditors) have view-only access. Financial statements and journal exceptions cannot be modified or approved.\'\\n        : \'Reviewers can stage adjustments and propose entries, but GAAP compliance requires sign-off from a certified Corporate Controller.\';\\n\\n    setDeniedNotice({\\n      action: actionName,\\n      reason,\\n    });\\n    return false;\\n  };\\n\\n  const contextValue: AuthContextType = {\\n    user,\\n    role,\\n    setRole,\\n    ...permissions,\\n    requireController,\\n    deniedNotice,\\n    clearDeniedNotice,\\n    usersByRole: PRESET_USERS,\\n  };\\n\\n  return (\\n    <AuthContext.Provider value={contextValue}>\\n      {children}\\n\\n      {/* Global Access Denied Security Modal */}\\n      {deniedNotice && (\\n        <div className=\\\"fixed inset-0 z-50 bg-black/85 backdrop-blur-sm flex items-center justify-center p-4\\\">\\n          <div className=\\\"bg-[#0f131c] border border-red-900/60 rounded-xl max-w-md w-full p-6 shadow-2xl relative animate-in fade-in zoom-in-95 duration-150\\\">\\n            <div className=\\\"w-12 h-12 rounded-full bg-red-950/80 border border-red-700/80 flex items-center justify-center mb-4 text-red-400\\\">\\n              <Lock className=\\\"w-6 h-6\\\" />\\n            </div>\\n\\n            <div className=\\\"flex items-center gap-2 mb-1\\\">\\n              <span className=\\\"text-[10px] font-mono uppercase tracking-widest text-red-400 bg-red-950/90 px-2 py-0.5 rounded border border-red-800/80\\\">\\n                Authorization Gate Enforced\\n              </span>\\n              <span className=\\\"text-xs text-slate-400 font-mono\\\">Role: {user.title}</span>\\n            </div>\\n\\n            <h3 className=\\\"text-lg font-bold text-white mb-2\\\">\\n              Action Blocked: {deniedNotice.action}\\n            </h3>\\n\\n            <p className=\\\"text-xs text-slate-300 leading-relaxed mb-4 font-mono bg-[#141926] p-3 rounded border border-neutral-800\\\">\\n              {deniedNotice.reason}\\n            </p>\\n\\n            <div className=\\\"space-y-2 mb-5 text-[11px] text-slate-400\\\">\\n              <div className=\\\"flex items-center gap-2\\\">\\n                <CheckCircle2 className=\\\"w-3.5 h-3.5 text-emerald-400 shrink-0\\\" />\\n                <span>Internal Controls Policy: Dual-sign-off SOX/GAAP separation.</span>\\n              </div>\\n              <div className=\\\"flex items-center gap-2\\\">\\n                <ShieldAlert className=\\\"w-3.5 h-3.5 text-amber-400 shrink-0\\\" />\\n                <span>Switch to <strong>Controller (Elena Rostova, CPA)</strong> in the top-right menu to exercise approval rights.</span>\\n              </div>\\n            </div>\\n\\n            <div className=\\\"flex items-center gap-3\\\">\\n              <button\\n                onClick={() => {\\n                  setRole(\'controller\');\\n                  clearDeniedNotice();\\n                }}\\n                className=\\\"flex-1 py-2 px-3 bg-emerald-600 hover:bg-emerald-500 text-white font-medium text-xs rounded transition-colors flex items-center justify-center gap-1.5\\\"\\n              >\\n                <UserCheck className=\\\"w-4 h-4\\\" />\\n                <span>Switch to Controller Role</span>\\n              </button>\\n              <button\\n                onClick={clearDeniedNotice}\\n                className=\\\"py-2 px-4 bg-neutral-800 hover:bg-neutral-700 text-slate-300 text-xs rounded transition-colors\\\"\\n              >\\n                Dismiss\\n              </button>\\n            </div>\\n          </div>\\n        </div>\\n      )}\\n    </AuthContext.Provider>\\n  );\\n}\\n\\nexport function useAuth(): AuthContextType {\\n  const context = useContext(AuthContext);\\n  if (!context) {\\n    throw new Error(\'useAuth must be used within an AuthProvider\');\\n  }\\n  return context;\\n}\\n\\n/**\\n * ControllerGate Component:\\n * Conditionally renders children if the active role is Controller.\\n * Otherwise, renders an accessible disabled state or informative fallback.\\n */\\nexport function ControllerGate({\\n  children,\\n  fallback,\\n  actionName = \'Controller Approval\',\\n}: {\\n  children: ReactNode;\\n  fallback?: ReactNode;\\n  actionName?: string;\\n}) {\\n  const { canApprove, role, requireController } = useAuth();\\n\\n  if (canApprove) {\\n    return <>{children}</>;\\n  }\\n\\n  if (fallback !== undefined) {\\n    return <>{fallback}</>;\\n  }\\n\\n  return (\\n    <div\\n      onClick={() => requireController(actionName, () => {})}\\n      className=\\\"inline-flex cursor-not-allowed opacity-60 hover:opacity-100 transition-opacity\\\"\\n      title={`Restricted to Controller role (current role: ${role})`}\\n    >\\n      <div className=\\\"pointer-events-none\\\">{children}</div>\\n    </div>\\n  );\\n}\\n\", \"Description\":\"Create AuthContext provider with role-based access control and authorization gate for Controller functions\", \"Overwrite\":true, \"TargetFile\":\"/src/context/AuthContext.tsx\", \"toolAction\":\"Creating AuthContext\", \"toolSummary\":\"Create AuthContext provider\"}"
      thinking_signature: "\022\275\'\n\272\'\001i\024}\023\307\227L\203\366\202\274ztA\211R\307\370\366cg\322\370\313\266\361\327\220\303\214o\217\252vr\312%\261\216\320\033\220\262\305t6\024(\000\300m\314d_\026jk\376\276 \300\252\b\375e\3709w\331_\240R\2575\261\032\251\225\030N[\020\210x\256_M\357Y`\273\314,e\232\303?\031\300]~/\335\260R\3230\310&O;7\375\314\360FwKd%\310\200L\223\203\325\002<\212\334C\b\\HJ\247\330\374\034#w\'\233A\334]\327Jv(4i]\a8\337]\301[6\260&\206[\255\261W+J\t\306\230M\272N!\343l\301<\024\354\200D\253\214S\a\227\344#\243\025\232\234Rh\351\177\033+H\323\240\367\333\037\372\336\033\376\313D\363\344DX\352\351&\240\227A$\317)C\246\332\362*\350\270$\345\234\333\377\200\202\306\321\314y\035\247t\347\324\261nx\370\337\016\215\372\206\307\207\324\262\016\036J\230\370~\213\356L\217Y`1\223\233\177zw+\365\002u\223\270\017\006\362\345\210\214;\232P\335\200\260\325pC8\264\005\366\265s\372j\252\036\366&)\006\240q\255\001\273\250\331?5D\354\334\262\005kpM\363h\316\031\006\310\344j\262\270\320\325/\351\256\3365\033\353\242\264@A\237O\033\254\306\302\237\036\306O\220\031\336\261\202\033\243\027`{E\237\333\036\306\373\251\267\226\266\352\302\353\364[~g\312OFO\001X\244,\375\306\b[\350\340\357\023V\233Uj\004B\272\235\2440\336\230\231\212\217\236;\231\244\004\352\372\262Y%\253\244\r\221\312Si\275-<\365\311\315\255\354X\323\255K\024N\362\242\257\333\272\r\032<\341\257\340\v\340\271$M\327\240TJh\0379\033?\032\023M+\202U,z\215\303\274\353q!\027\311`u<|\005\025\307\312\255b8\002\0006I(!\001\266d\263W!\2739y\t\366/z\313_/\264\220v\272M$\330\220\b\034\233*\223\351\036\352{\265\360\206\225N7`r\3331\036\211\327\332\277\227\f\323+\343\261\206\337\302\n\220(Z\211\020N0wX\020\376\263\265\324\276d7\211\347\325\025\333\212\"\\\344\2467?\'\272\025\336\022\234\273\232:\253\270\223c\216g\201%\021\000#\232H\351\243\314\304\210\235\240O\327\255\241\364\231qH\035\024|}\036o\332\234D\241^5\214\230\212w\353\000\371e\251\237\303\354D\035\026S\360\236\236]\223>\343\350\253;J\312\030a(