    thinking: "**Revising App Setup**\n\nI\'m currently focused on the structural implementation. The plan is to import the authentication context components: `AuthProvider, useAuth, UserRole`. I also need to import the `OnboardingTour` component. Within the App file, I will rename the main App function to `AppContent` and make sure to wrap `AppContent` with the `AuthProvider` component.\n\n\n**Implementing Role Controls**\n\nI\'ve been working on integrating role-based access control throughout the application. Specifically, I\'m updating components in the `Exceptions` tab to show/hide functionality based on user roles. I\'ve successfully implemented lock icons on restricted buttons and added a role restriction banner for non-approvers. Additionally, the new \"Interactive Tour\" button and user profile badge are now linked to set the `isTourOpen` state and `setCurrentRole`, respectively. Finally, I\'m ensuring that controller-only actions wrap in `requireController(...)`.\n\n\n"
