            }
            lines {
              text: "                <p>"
              type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_UNCHANGED
            }
            lines {
              text: "                  <strong>Institutional Accounting Memory in pgvector:</strong> Every company has bespoke accounting rules (custom enterprise renewals, capitalized R&D thresholds under ASC 350-40, commission amortization under ASC 340-40). FrogeClose stores these in tenant-isolated vector memory. Switching away means losing institutional close memory."
