  planner_response {
    thinking: "**Examining App.tsx**\n\nI\'m now diving into `src/App.tsx` and focusing on integrating the full feature set. The current tabs are \'memo\', \'pnl\', \'variance\', \'reconciliation\', \'exceptions\', \'verification\', and \'evaluation\'. I\'ll be methodically working through the application to integrate them.\n\n\n**Adding Key Features**\n\nI\'m now thinking about ways to make the application even better, focusing on new features. I\'m considering a \'Differentiators\' tab with Stripe payout tie-out and missing-accrual detection, and a \'Firm Workspace\' for multi-client status and white-label export. The \'Evaluation\' tab will include benchmarks. Automated test suites will be added to enhance usability. Finally, a demo mode is being considered to onboard users.\n\n\n**Developing Audit-Ready Exports**\n\nI\'m now integrating the auditor package generation, focusing on the export of comprehensive documentation. This includes an attestation, invariant verification details, revenue recognition schedules, bank reconciliations, and the audit chain root hash. I\'m also planning the evidence drill-down modal to provide transaction-level detail. The user interface will highlight that the prototype uses synthetic data.\n\n\n"
