    thinking: "**Analyzing Component Structure**\n\nI\'ve been examining the project structure, finding it well-organized and modular. Currently, I\'m focusing on the `App.tsx` file and its child components. I\'m planning to introduce a new tab labeled \"differentiators\" within the navigation. This tab will have specific sub-sections, starting with a section for the \"Stripe Payout Penny Tie-Out\" featuring its gross volume of $1,4.\n\n\n**Developing New Features**\n\nI\'m now prioritizing the implementation of new features. Specifically, I\'m focusing on adding a \'firm\\_workspace\' tab. Within this, I\'m working on a Multi-Client Status Board and a White-label board pack export preview. I\'m also considering some growth tools like a design-partner invite link generator. I\'m also planning an \'verification\' tab, starting with an interactive \"Run All 8 Automated Test Suites\" button.\n\n\n**Implementing Verification Checks**\n\nI\'m now focused on incorporating verification features. I plan to include a button under the \'evaluation\' tab that runs a synthetic transaction benchmark, displaying accuracy metrics and transaction comparisons. Additionally, I will add an \'audit\' tab to verify the SHA-256 hash chain and simulate tampering for testing. Finally, I\'m designing a 60-second guided demo to showcase the process, from CSV upload to certified audit package export.\n\n\n"
