    thinking: "**Incorporating Missing Elements**\n\nI\'m working on integrating the final pieces from `src/App.tsx`. I\'ve added two new navigation tabs. The first, labeled \"differentiators,\" now includes sections for Stripe Payout Tie-Out, Missing Accruals Detector, and Policy. These are the last items from the plan, and now they are displayed in the new UI.\n\n\n**Adding New UI Features**\n\nI\'ve just added several new features across multiple tabs. In the `verification` tab, there\'s a fully functional \"Run All 8 Automated Test Suites\" panel now displaying real-time test results and execution time. The `evaluation` tab now has an interactive \"Run Live 200 Transaction Benchmark\" button, which dynamically computes metrics and showcases anomaly samples. Finally, the `audit` tab has a \"Verify SHA-256 Hash Chain\" button and a \"Simulate Tampering\" button. I\'m also adding a new 60-second guided demo.\n\n\n"
