  planner_response {
    thinking: "**Expanding App Content**\n\nI\'m currently updating the `AppContent` type. The goal is to broaden the scope of `activeTab` to include several new options. I\'ve added \'memo\', \'pnl\', \'variance\', \'reconciliation\', \'differentiators\', \'firm_workspace\', \'exceptions\', \'verification\', \'evaluation\', \'competition\', and \'market\' to the acceptable values. This should provide greater flexibility and control over the application\'s interface.\n\n\n**Adding New Functionality**\n\nI\'ve just added several new states to the application. These include states for differentiators, test suite reports, running tests, evaluation metrics, and stripe tie-outs. I\'ve also integrated states for missing accruals, policy queries, policy lists, manual day baselines, days scoreboards, and guided demo functionality. I am also working on drill down data functionality. These new additions should enrich the user experience and enhance our data analysis capabilities.\n\n\n"
