              type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_UNCHANGED
            }
            lines {
              text: "                - <strong>Sales Commission Capitalization (ASC 340-40):</strong> Cash sales commission payouts totaled $495,000 for Q3. Under ASC 340-40 (Contracts with Customers - Cost Capitalization), these qualifying incremental contract acquisition costs are capitalized to the Balance Sheet and amortized ratably over the 36-month estimated customer contract life. Q3 commission amortization expensed to Sales & Marketing was $41,250, resulting in ending capitalized contract cost assets of $773,750 on the Balance Sheet."
              type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_UNCHANGED
            }
            lines {
              text: "              </p>"
