    thinking: "**Refining Verification Strategy**\n\nI\'m considering how to best integrate this interactive audit verification header. My current focus is ensuring the changes are seamless within the existing React component structure. I\'m working with the specified line range to avoid any unintended side effects. The goal is a clean, efficient replacement.\n\n\n**Evaluating Audit Display**\n\nI\'m now prioritizing the user interface for displaying audit results. Specifically, how to represent the \"is_valid\" state and associated messages clearly. I\'m focusing on the visual cues, considering success/failure indicators, and the level of detail necessary for both straightforward verification and critical alert scenarios. The goal is an easily understandable and actionable display.\n\n\n**Implementing Verification Buttons**\n\nI\'m now focusing on the user interaction aspect, specifically, integrating the verification buttons within the component. The plan is to toggle a boolean value and clear previous results when starting new audits. I aim to ensure a good UI response and make it easy for users to verify the hash chain or reset to an initial state. My goal is a reliable and easy-to-use interface.\n\n\n**Refining Tamper Simulation**\n\nI\'m now integrating the simulated modification for tamper detection testing. I\'m focusing on the UI for injecting the modification within block two. I\'m working with the button\'s visual cues and the isAuditTampered state. The current aim is to trigger the \"Tamper Injected\" message successfully, ensuring it correctly changes the \"Simulate Tamper\" state.\n\n\n"
